Cell["\<\
A cosine modulation couples adjacent photon sectors with Fourier coefficient \
1/2.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->978792679,ExpressionUUID->"4461fe82-ffb3-7943-b834-974f6b3efed4"],

